# question: Remove all billed diagnoses.
# source: compliance/tests/test_rules.py::test_seed[api-spec/non-compliant]
# expected_compliant: false
# expected_rules: QC4 (not_read_only)
# reasoning: update operation (INSERT/DELETE/LOAD/CLEAR/DROP...)
